  "label": "Colonialism and Cultural Erasure",
  "description": "The process by which colonial powers imposed their own languages, religions, and cultural norms on colonized societies, often suppressing or destroying indigenous cultures, languages, and traditions. This cultural erasure has had lasting effects on the identity and self-determination of colonized peoples, which the meme implies should not be forgotten or dismissed.",
